            are isomorphisms.
          %p
          .num_theorem
            %h6 Theorem
            %p For univalent categories, isomorphism of categories and equivalence of categories coincide.
          %p …
          %p
          .num_lemma
            %h6 Lemma
            %p In a univalent category, the type of objects is a 1-type.
          %p
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              It suffices to show that for any
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
